<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Nvidia has reportedly halted chip shipment=
s to south-east Asia, as the sell-off in stock markets eased.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The US chipmaker, which is at the heart of=
 the AI boom, has told manufacturing partners such as Dell and Supermicro t=
o stop shipping servers containing its chips to Malaysia, Singapore, Thaila=
nd and Indonesia, according to the Financial Times, citing three unnamed so=
urces.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It is unclear whether this is a temporary =
halt. Washington has increased export controls to prevent Chinese access to=
 AI computing power.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Some calm returned to Asian markets after =
sharp declines on Wednesday. South Korea=E2=80=99s Kospi rose 0.45%, a day =
after its 7.05% tumble. Japan=E2=80=99s Nikkei gained 0.86%, Hong Kong=E2=
=80=99s Hang Seng climbed 1.6% and China=E2=80=99s CSI 300 was flat.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Beijing has issued a measured response to =
Donald Trump=E2=80=99s latest proposed US tariffs, saying China and the US =
should resolve their trade issues through talks, based on equality, mutual =
respect and reciprocity.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Chinese foreign ministry spokesperson =
Guo Jiakun told reporters at a briefing: =E2=80=9CThe so-called overcapacit=
y is a false premise, and China opposes it being used as a pretext for poli=
tical manipulation.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The US president is proposing new tariffs =
on 14 trading partners, including China and the EU, that would go into effe=
ct early next year, the office of the US trade representative said on Wedne=
sday.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The administration is <a href=3D"https://a=
blink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.SZCCLlO0AeAAEu5IDOYbYGRpSLPTVtdtK=
msR2qB75TAq5SIuro2iAUxIO61D_affZojb6TYJrUJsp9IEGvic8q2wOgd0iKwWSTKyOiZoCX4O=
